  "dn20:16.14": "bhikkhūnaṃ samitiṃ vanaṃ. ",
  "dn20:17.1": "sukkā karumhā aruṇā ",
  "dn20:17.2": "āgū veghanasā saha. ",
  "dn20:17.3": "odātagayhā pāmokkhā ",
  "dn20:17.4": "āgū devā vicakkhaṇā ",
  "dn20:17.5": "sadāmattā hāragajā ",
  "dn20:17.6": "missakā ca yasassino ",
  "dn20:17.7": "thanayaṃ āgā pajunno ",
